    "Klassisk fargelære (Johannes Itten for RYB); D. B. Judd og G. Wyszecki: «Color in Business, Science, and Industry» (naturlig fargeorden); A. Zeileis, K. Hornik, P. Murrell: «Escaping RGBland: Selecting colors for statistical graphics», Computational Statistics & Data Analysis 53(9), 2009, og D. A. Green: «A colour scheme for the display of astronomical intensity images», Bulletin of the Astronomical Society of India 39, 2011 (tonebane); avbildningene er utviklet for Kolorist": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classical colour theory (Johannes Itten for RYB); D. B. Judd and G. Wyszecki: “Color in Business, Science, and Industry” (natural colour order); A. Zeileis, K. Hornik, P. Murrell: “Escaping RGBland: Selecting colors for statistical graphics”, Computational Statistics & Data Analysis 53(9), 2009, and D. A. Green: “A colour scheme for the display of astronomical intensity images”, Bulletin of the Astronomical Society of India 39, 2011 (tone path); the mappings were developed for Kolorist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
