            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Picked colours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prøvene viser fargen med lysets fulle fargestikk, slik et foto med dagslys-hvitbalanse ville vist den.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The swatches show the colour with the full colour cast of the light, as a photo with daylight white balance would show it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prøvene viser fargen slik den oppleves i lyset: øyet tilpasser seg lysets farge nesten helt, og svakt lys gir mindre fargerike farger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The swatches show the colour as it is perceived in the light: the eye adapts almost fully to the colour of the light, and dim light makes colours less colourful."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "På, %lld prosent": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On, %lld percent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
